%% Investigation workflow
flowchart LR
  A[Signal: Alert / Insight / User ask] --> B[Triage impact radius]
  B --> C{Need case?}
  C -->|Yes| D[Create / Open Case]
  C -->|No| E[Transient Explore]
  D --> F[Attach entities]
  E --> F
  F --> G[Timeline scrub + correlate]
  G --> H[AI RCA hypotheses]
  H --> I[Validate evidence]
  I --> J{Remediate?}
  J -->|Automation| K[Guarded job]
  J -->|Change| L[Change / Release]
  J -->|Remote action| M[Remote action]
  K --> N[Monitor rebound]
  L --> N
  M --> N
  N --> O[Seal evidence · Resolve case]

