%% Case lifecycle
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> New
  New --> Active: assign owner
  Active --> Monitoring: mitigation applied
  Monitoring --> Active: regression
  Active --> Resolved: confirmed recovery
  Monitoring --> Resolved: stable window
  Resolved --> Closed: seal + retrospective
  Closed --> [*]
  Active --> Closed: duplicate / cancel
